  "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Match the English instruction suffix in the injection pattern**\n\nThe explicit `all\\s+previous` alternative is followed by the Portuguese-only suffix `instru[çc][oõ]es?`, so `Ignore all previous instructions` does not match this expression or any other pattern in the list. Calling the hook with that exact input returns `isSafe: true`, bypassing the English injection case this alternative is intended to detect. Give the English alternative an `instructions?` suffix and add a regression test for the complete phrase.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
